50 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 30 0 R
/E (In Visakhapatnam, Anakapalli, and ASR districts, thousands of persons with disabilities lack access to affordable and comprehensive rehabilitation due to weak public health systems and poverty, limiting access to therapy, assistive devices, and early intervention. The Ability People TAP bridges this gap through inclusive, community linked rehabilitation, enabling individuals to live with independence and dignity.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
